 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545017,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the winner of the election by the Borda count method.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>First place earns (4 – 1) or 3 points.</p>\n<p>Second place earns (4 – 2) or 2 points.</p>\n<p>Third place earns (4 – 3) or 1 point.</p>\n<p>Fourth place earns (4 – 4) or 0 points.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Ballots</th>\n<th>9</th>\n<th>11</th>\n<th>7</th>\n<th>6</th>\n<th>3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(J) Jim Halpert (John Krasinski)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(P) Pam Beesly-Halpert (Jenna Fischer)</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(D) Dwight Schrute (Rainn Wilson)</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(M) Michael Scott (Steve Carell)</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Jim Halpert: 9(3) + 11(2) + 7(0) + 6(2) + 3(0) = 61</p>\n<p>Pam Beesley-Halpert: 9(0) + 11(3) + 7(2) + 6(0) + 3(1) = 50</p>\n<p>Dwight Schrute: 9(2) + 11(1) + 7(1) + 6(3) + 3(2) = 60</p>\n<p>Michael Scott: 9(1) + 11(0) + 7(3) + 6(1) + 3(3) = 45</p>\n<p>Jim Halpert wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Jim wins."
    }
   ],
